{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794323176533,"sessionID":"ses_e3a013904ffelr9NSWjQE3rzm2","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_01_zs9wwg2u17ev2hjbnsijzduh","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/README.md"},"output":"<path>/workspace/README.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # App\n2: \n3: ## Run contract\n4: \n5: - The app is built from `Dockerfile` in this directory and the container listens on port 8000.\n6: - The API is served under `/api`. `GET /api/health` answers `{\"status\": \"ok\"}` once the app is ready.\n7: - The backend also serves the frontend build at `/`.\n8: - Persistent data lives in `./data` (relative to the working directory `/app`).\n9: \n10: ## Layout\n11: \n12: - `backend/`: the Flask app (`backend/app.py`, served by gunicorn as `app:app`); dependencies in `backend/requirements.txt`.\n13: - `frontend/`: a Vite project (React + TypeScript). `npm run build` writes `frontend/dist`, which the image copies next to the backend.\n14: \n15: Dependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved versions and is installed as a pip constraints file. The frontend uses `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`). When you change dependencies, update the lock file as well (or remove it).\n\n(End of file - total 15 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# App\n\n## Run contract\n\n- The app is built from `Dockerfile` in this directory and the container listens on port 8000.\n- The API is served under `/api`. `GET /api/health` answers `{\"status\": \"ok\"}` once the app is ready.\n- The backend also serves the frontend build at `/`.\n- Persistent data lives in `./data` (relative to the working directory `/app`).\n\n## Layout\n\n- `backend/`: the Flask app (`backend/app.py`, served by gunicorn as `app:app`); dependencies in `backend/requirements.txt`.\n- `frontend/`: a Vite project (React + TypeScript). `npm run build` writes `frontend/dist`, which the image copies next to the backend.\n\nDependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved versions and is installed as a pip constraints file. The frontend uses `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`). When you change dependencies, update the lock file as well (or remove it).","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/workspace/README.md","text":"# App\n\n## Run contract\n\n- The app is built from `Dockerfile` in this directory and the container listens on port 8000.\n- The API is served under `/api`. `GET /api/health` answers `{\"status\": \"ok\"}` once the app is ready.\n- The backend also serves the frontend build at `/`.\n- Persistent data lives in `./data` (relative to the working directory `/app`).\n\n## Layout\n\n- `backend/`: the Flask app (`backend/app.py`, served by gunicorn as `app:app`); dependencies in `backend/requirements.txt`.\n- `frontend/`: a Vite project (React + TypeScript). `npm run build` writes `frontend/dist`, which the image copies next to the backend.\n\nDependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved versions and is installed as a pip constraints file. The frontend uses `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`). When you change dependencies, update the lock file as well (or remove it).","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":15,"totalLines":15,"truncated":false}},"title":"README.md","time":{"start":1794323176453,"end":1794323176483}},"id":"prt_1c5fedbf80012ZBsxWs24dWqNV","sessionID":"ses_e3a013904ffelr9NSWjQE3rzm2","messageID":"msg_1c5feccfa001wlqjg1l35uyEU5"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794323176767,"sessionID":"ses_e3a013904ffelr9NSWjQE3rzm2","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_00_fcotdttej8662c16iqnmbrgd","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"ls -la /workspace && find /workspace -maxdepth 3 -type f -not -path '*/node_modules/*' -not -path '*/.git/*' | sort"},"output":"total 32\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 node node 4096 Nov 10 15:06 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 root root 4096 Nov 10 15:06 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node  118 Jan  1  1970 .dockerignore\ndrwxr-xr-x 8 node node 4096 Nov 10 15:06 .git\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node 1062 Jan  1  1970 Dockerfile\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node  887 Jan  1  1970 README.md\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 node node 4096 Jan  1  1970 backend\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 node node 4096 Jan  1  1970 frontend\n/workspace/.dockerignore\n/workspace/Dockerfile\n/workspace/README.md\n/workspace/backend/app.py\n/workspace/backend/requirements.lock\n/workspace/backend/requirements.txt\n/workspace/frontend/index.html\n/workspace/frontend/package-lock.json\n/workspace/frontend/package.json\n/workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx\n/workspace/frontend/src/main.tsx\n/workspace/frontend/vite.config.ts\n","metadata":{"output":"total 32\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 node node 4096 Nov 10 15:06 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 root root 4096 Nov 10 15:06 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node  118 Jan  1  1970 .dockerignore\ndrwxr-xr-x 8 node node 4096 Nov 10 15:06 .git\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node 1062 Jan  1  1970 Dockerfile\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node  887 Jan  1  1970 README.md\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 node node 4096 Jan  1  1970 backend\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 node node 4096 Jan  1  1970 frontend\n/workspace/.dockerignore\n/workspace/Dockerfile\n/workspace/README.md\n/workspace/backend/app.py\n/workspace/backend/requirements.lock\n/workspace/backend/requirements.txt\n/workspace/frontend/index.html\n/workspace/frontend/package-lock.json\n/workspace/frontend/package.json\n/workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx\n/workspace/frontend/src/main.tsx\n/workspace/frontend/vite.config.ts\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"ls -la /workspace && find /workspace -maxdepth 3 -type f -not -path '*/node_modules/*' -not -path '*/.git/*' | sort","time":{"start":1794323176436,"end":1794323176655}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c5fedbe7001T5EERHn8XStCMP","sessionID":"ses_e3a013904ffelr9NSWjQE3rzm2","messageID":"msg_1c5feccfa001wlqjg1l35uyEU5"}}
